WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.510
Come on, you.
Get the show on the road.

00:00:02.510 --> 00:00:04.640
You got a bunch of stuff
to talk about.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:07.480
And you don't love me,
right?

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:09.100
If you really love me,

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.940
You'll give you the one thing
that I really crave,

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:15.490
which is a divorce.

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:17.110
I was super
excited to work with you

00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:19.280
because I've been such
a fan of yours.

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:20.320
And then you came in.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:21.910
You just blew
everybody away.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:23.330
Take off your glasses.

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:25.160
Are you trying
to divorce me on acid?

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:26.200
You're not thinking
straight.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.920
That's
why I'm thinking straight.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:31.580
This isn't old Peggy
Newman.

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:33.170
I’m a P.I.

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:34.550
and I'm working up
a case.

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:35.670
Is that a lady’s finger?

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:37.670
Ta-da!

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:39.970
It’s nice to do something where
there's so much history

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:41.140
right at the onset.

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:42.140
This just sounds like

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:43.430
another
one of those crazy things

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:44.970
you're
trying between rehabs.

00:00:44.970 --> 00:00:47.560
Come on. I'm like Mary
Tyler Moore on methadone.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:50.600
Peggy,
to me, is a real hustler.

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:53.310
But you are the only person
who out hustles her.

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:54.360
There she is.

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:55.980
Are you fucking kidding me?

00:00:56.230 --> 00:00:57.900
But Danny is a schemer.

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:01.240
But he really believes
in this new spiritual path.

00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:03.200
I've got an email
list of men

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:03.740
who are looking for

00:01:03.740 --> 00:01:06.160
a safe place
to practice Qigong and shit.

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:08.620
We meet him early
in this story,

00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:10.250
and he wants his woman back.

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:11.670
He wants his wife back.

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:13.000
Look at you.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:13.590
I know.

00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:15.920
You're fuckin Phoenix, baby.

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:18.420
He hasn't decided
that they're divorced yet.

00:01:18.630 --> 00:01:20.010
Trust me, I'm the man.

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:21.180
I'm going to take care of
things.

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:22.510
It'll be good for us
in the end.

00:01:22.510 --> 00:01:24.510
You're such a fucking liar.

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:27.350
I only lied so we could be
together when I got out.

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:31.020
Can I have a coffee
and an apple pie

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:34.110
and a prime rib to go and
give this fucker the check?

00:01:35.230 --> 00:01:36.860
They both have these wedding

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:38.990
bands
tattooed to their fingers,

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:41.700
but hers has been covered
with an ax.

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:44.240
You know, Peg,
I choose to focus

00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:45.950
on the good times,
not the bad.

00:01:45.950 --> 00:01:48.830
You ruined the holiday Teddy.

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:50.540
It's very authentic to me.

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:52.370
And that's the thing
that I like

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:54.080
more than anything
about this.

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:56.340
The best
parts of them are aligned

00:01:56.710 --> 00:01:58.920
and the worst parts of them
are aligned.

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:01.010
Maybe I’ve been
a little hard on you.

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:03.800
I still want to give you
the benefit of the doubt.

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:04.640
You know.

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:05.850
I am trying.

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:08.100
Thank you for seeing that.

00:02:08.510 --> 00:02:11.390
Can I call you back?

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:13.560
Where would you see
Peggy and Denny

00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:14.310
10 years from now,

00:02:15.560 --> 00:02:17.360
if they're both alive

